# Create Account

Post Auth required

Create a new Options trading account

## Endpoint

Post `/trading/v1/options/accounts`

Base URL: `https://api.derivws.com`

## Request Schema

#### `headers` — Required `object`

**Object Properties:**

  ##### `Deriv-App-ID` — Required `string`

  Application identifier

  ##### `Authorization` — Required `string`

  Bearer token for authentication

  ##### `Content-Type` — Required `string | enum`

  Content type

  Allowed values: `"application/json"`

#### `body` — Required `object`

**Object Properties:**

  ##### `currency` — Required `string | enum`

  Account currency

  Allowed values: `"USD"`

  ##### `group` — Required `string | enum`

  Account group

  Allowed values: `"row"`

  ##### `account_type` — Required `string | enum`

  Account type

  Allowed values: `"demo"`, `"real"`

## Response Schema

### 200 OK - Account Already Exists

#### `data` — Optional `object`

**Object Properties:**

  ##### `account_id` — Required `string`

  Account ID

  ##### `balance` — Required `number`

  Account balance

  ##### `currency` — Required `string`

  Account currency

  ##### `group` — Required `string`

  Account group

  ##### `status` — Required `string | enum`

  Account status

  Allowed values: `"active"`, `"inactive"`

  ##### `account_type` — Required `string | enum`

  Account type

  Allowed values: `"demo"`, `"real"`

#### `meta` — Optional `object`

**Object Properties:**

  ##### `endpoint` — Required `string`

